 506:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief Disable GPIO pull-down state in Standby and Shutdown modes.
 507:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  Reset the relevant PDy bits of PWR_PDCRx register used to configure the I/O
 508:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        in pull-down state in Standby and Shutdown modes.
 509:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  Even if a PDy bit to reset is reserved, the other PDy bits entered as input
 510:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        parameter at the same time are reset.
 511:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param GPIO Specifies the IO port. This parameter can be PWR_GPIO_A..PWR_GPIO_H
 512:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         to select the GPIO peripheral.
 513:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param GPIONumber Specify the I/O pins numbers.
 514:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 515:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         PWR_GPIO_BIT_0, ..., PWR_GPIO_BIT_15 (except for PORTH where less
 516:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         I/O pins are available) or the logical OR of several of them to reset
 517:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         several bits for a given port in a single API call.
 518:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL Status
 519:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   */
