1253:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c **** /**
1254:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief Enter Shutdown mode.
1255:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  In Shutdown mode, the PLL, the HSI, the MSI, the LSI and the HSE oscillators are switche
1256:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        off. The voltage regulator is disabled and Vcore domain is powered off.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\843E~1\AppData\Local\Temp\cck9wj2S.s 			page 123


1257:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        SRAM1, SRAM2, BKRAM and registers contents are lost except for registers in the Backup d
1258:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *        The BOR is not available.
1259:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note  The I/Os can be configured either with a pull-up or pull-down or can be kept in analog s
